      "writtenOn": "2020-02-14T16:10:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because libraries other than libc++ might have a dependency on the unwinder (e.g. because they contain an exception handler and therefore depend on _Unwind_Resume). Without this, the library will attempt to dynamically link against the unwinder in libc which will fail on Android 10.",
      "parentUuid": "089b4a25_f4468eb6",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 185,
        "startChar": 4,
