      "side": 1,
      "message": "That\u0027s not true at the moment. /apex/com.android.vndk.vR/lib64/libyuv.so is built with -fexceptions (see https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:external/libyuv/files/Android.bp;l\u003d59 ). Furthermore libraries can depend on the unsinder without being built with exceptions, e.g. /apex/com.android.art.debug/lib64/libpac.so contains references to _Unwind_Backtrace and _Unwind_GetIP via https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:external/libchrome/base/debug/stack_trace_android.cc.",
